{"seq":3,"slug":"cloud-big-data-deployment","title":"云上大数据部署","url":"/l-doc-books/education/vocational/higher-vocational/big-data-technology/data-engineering-practice/cloud-big-data-deployment","wordCount":862,"readingTime":4,"html":"<h1 id=\"云上大数据部署\">云上大数据部署</h1><h2 id=\"知识要点\">知识要点</h2><p>2026 年的大数据基础设施已全面云化——超过 80% 的企业选择在公有云上运行大数据工作负载。云平台提供弹性伸缩、免运维、按需付费的优势，大数据工程师需要掌握主流云平台的数据服务和 DataOps 实践。</p>\n<h3 id=\"阿里云-maxcompute\">阿里云 MaxCompute</h3><p>MaxCompute（原 ODPS）是阿里云的 Serverless 大数据计算平台，支持 PB 级数据的 SQL 分析和机器学习：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"-- MaxCompute SQL：与 Hive SQL 高度兼容&#10;-- 创建分区表&#10;CREATE TABLE IF NOT EXISTS dws_order_stats (&#10;    user_id         STRING,&#10;    order_count     BIGINT,&#10;    total_amount    DECIMAL(12, 2),&#10;    avg_amount      DECIMAL(10, 2)&#10;)&#10;PARTITIONED BY (dt STRING)&#10;LIFECYCLE 365;               -- 365 天自动过期删除&#10;&#10;-- 数据写入&#10;INSERT OVERWRITE TABLE dws_order_stats PARTITION (dt=&#39;2026-05-07&#39;)&#10;SELECT&#10;    user_id,&#10;    COUNT(*) AS order_count,&#10;    SUM(amount) AS total_amount,&#10;    AVG(amount) AS avg_amount&#10;FROM dwd_order_detail&#10;WHERE dt = &#39;2026-05-07&#39;&#10;GROUP BY user_id;&#10;&#10;-- 窗口函数 + 数据分层&#10;SELECT user_id, total_amount,&#10;       NTILE(10) OVER (ORDER BY total_amount DESC) AS decile&#10;FROM dws_order_stats&#10;WHERE dt = &#39;2026-05-07&#39;;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- MaxCompute SQL：与 Hive SQL 高度兼容</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 创建分区表</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CREATE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> TABLE</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> IF</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> EXISTS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> dws_order_stats (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    user_id         STRING,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    order_count     </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">BIGINT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    total_amount    </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">DECIMAL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">12</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    avg_amount      </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">DECIMAL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">10</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">PARTITIONED </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">BY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (dt STRING)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">LIFECYCLE </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">365</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;               </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 365 天自动过期删除</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 数据写入</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">INSERT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> OVERWRITE </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TABLE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> dws_order_stats </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">PARTITION</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (dt</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'2026-05-07'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">SELECT</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    user_id,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    COUNT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> order_count,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    SUM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(amount) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> total_amount,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    AVG</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(amount) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> avg_amount</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> dwd_order_detail</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> dt </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> '2026-05-07'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">GROUP BY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> user_id;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 窗口函数 + 数据分层</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">SELECT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> user_id, total_amount,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">       NTILE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">10</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">OVER</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">ORDER BY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> total_amount </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">DESC</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> decile</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> dws_order_stats</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> dt </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> '2026-05-07'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>MaxCompute 成本模型</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>按量付费</strong>：每扫描 1TB 数据收费约 ¥150（适合临时查询）</li>\n<li><strong>包年包月</strong>：购买固定 CU（计算单元），适合稳定负载</li>\n<li><strong>优化策略</strong>：分区裁剪、列裁剪、小文件合并</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"aws-emr-elastic-mapreduce\">AWS EMR（Elastic MapReduce）</h3><p>AWS EMR 是全托管的 Hadoop/Spark 集群服务：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"python\" data-code=\"# 使用 boto3 创建 EMR 集群&#10;import boto3&#10;&#10;emr = boto3.client(&#39;emr&#39;, region_name=&#39;us-east-1&#39;)&#10;&#10;cluster_id = emr.run_job_flow(&#10;    Name=&#39;daily-etl-cluster&#39;,&#10;    ReleaseLabel=&#39;emr-7.0.0&#39;,&#10;    Applications=[&#10;        {&#39;Name&#39;: &#39;Spark&#39;},&#10;        {&#39;Name&#39;: &#39;Hive&#39;},&#10;        {&#39;Name&#39;: &#39;Presto&#39;}&#10;    ],&#10;    Instances={&#10;        &#39;MasterInstanceType&#39;: &#39;m6g.2xlarge&#39;,&#10;        &#39;SlaveInstanceType&#39;: &#39;r6g.4xlarge&#39;,&#10;        &#39;InstanceCount&#39;: 5,&#10;        &#39;Ec2SubnetId&#39;: &#39;subnet-xxx&#39;,&#10;        &#39;KeepJobFlowAliveWhenNoSteps&#39;: False,  # 作业完成后自动销毁&#10;    },&#10;    Steps=[{&#10;        &#39;Name&#39;: &#39;Spark ETL Job&#39;,&#10;        &#39;ActionOnFailure&#39;: &#39;TERMINATE_CLUSTER&#39;,&#10;        &#39;HadoopJarStep&#39;: {&#10;            &#39;Jar&#39;: &#39;command-runner.jar&#39;,&#10;            &#39;Args&#39;: [&#10;                &#39;spark-submit&#39;,&#10;                &#39;--deploy-mode&#39;, &#39;cluster&#39;,&#10;                &#39;--class&#39;, &#39;com.company.DailyETL&#39;,&#10;                &#39;s3://my-bucket/jars/etl.jar&#39;,&#10;                &#39;--date&#39;, &#39;2026-05-07&#39;&#10;            ]&#10;        }&#10;    }],&#10;    LogUri=&#39;s3://my-bucket/emr-logs/&#39;,&#10;    JobFlowRole=&#39;EMR_EC2_DefaultRole&#39;,&#10;    ServiceRole=&#39;EMR_DefaultRole&#39;,&#10;)[&#39;JobFlowId&#39;]\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 使用 boto3 创建 EMR 集群</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> boto3</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">emr </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> boto3.client(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'emr'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">region_name</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'us-east-1'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">cluster_id </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> emr.run_job_flow(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    Name</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'daily-etl-cluster'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    ReleaseLabel</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span st